<p>I also highly recommend the guides at <a href="https://github.com/codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x?tab=readme-ov-file">build-your-own-x</a>.</p>
<p>build-your-own-x is a collection of guides for many different programming languages going over how to make your own.. X.
These can be things like web servers, voxel engines, or even operatng systems!
</p>
<p>There's even more projects at <a href="https://github.com/practical-tutorials/project-based-learning#cc">project-based-learning</a>, a similar collection to build-your-own-x.</p>

